title: Payers › Documents › Edit the list
route: /payers/summit?tab=documents
intro: 'Edit list' changes the documents for the one level of care shown. Rows can be renamed, added and removed; there is no reordering. A reason is required and each change is logged. New drafts use the list at once; open drafts wait for 'Update drafts'.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Edit list'\non the document card"
overlay m "Edit what Summit wants for Residential 3.5\nReader uses this same list on the intake screen."
process lvl "Edits only the level of care shown\nTo change IOP, close this and switch 'Level of care' first"
screen rws "One row per document\nNumber, document name box, 'What it must show' box, bin"
input i1 "Type a document name"
input i2 "Type 'What it must show'\nExample: Within 14 days"
click rm "Click the bin\n'Remove document 4'"
process rm2 "Row vanishes at once\nNo confirmation, numbers close up"
click ad "Click 'Add a document'"
process nw "Blank row added at the end"
input i3 "Type 'Reason for the edit' (required)"
click cs "Click 'Save and log the edit'"
decision d1 "Is the reason empty?"
toast er "Add a reason. It goes in the edit log."
process cl "Drop rows whose name is blank, trim the rest"
process df "Compare with the saved list\n'Added a document', Changed 'name', 'Removed a document'"
decision d2 "Did anything change?"
toast t0 "'Nothing changed'"
store st "Document list for that level of care replaced"
store lg "One edit log entry per change\nArea 'Documents'"
store un "'Edits waiting' goes up by one"
toast t1 "'Residential 3.5 list saved'\nReader uses it on the intake screen from now on.\nOpen drafts follow when you update them."
screen out "Documents tab shows the new list and count\nBanner '1 edit applies to new drafts only'"
process ck "'Try it on a case' now reads the new list\nA removed document can no longer be 'still needed'"
click cx "Click 'Cancel'"
click cesc "Press Escape, click the X\nor click the dimmed area"
endx x1 "Modal closes\nNothing saved"
end e1 "Edited list is in force for new drafts"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Documents › Try it on a case"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Edits waiting › Update drafts"
goto g3 "Continues in: Payers › Configuration feeds the rest of the app"

s1 --> m --> lvl --> rws
rws --> i1 --> i2 --> i3
rws --> rm --> rm2 --> i3
rws --> ad --> nw --> i1
i3 --> cs --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| er --> i3
d1 -->|No| cl --> df --> d2
d2 -->|No| t0 --> x1
d2 -->|Yes| st --> lg --> un --> t1 --> out --> e1
out --> ck --> g1
out -.-> g2
t1 -.-> g3
m --> cx --> x1
m --> cesc --> x1
